  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 15957767808872448
    m_Localized: Bar cabinet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957772766539776
    m_Localized: Found in an abandoned building during a raid by a cult. In good
      condition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957799056437248
    m_Localized: Bottles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957833915297792
    m_Localized: Absolutely empty, might be useful for decorating a shelf
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957851929833472
    m_Localized: Bowl of candies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957869424275456
    m_Localized: There are DEFINITELY no sleeping pills among the candies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957874058981376
    m_Localized: Kitchen jars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957900759920640
    m_Localized: No idea what's inside, but they look nice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957917121900544
    m_Localized: Cat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957930673696768
    m_Localized: If it looks sad, just pet it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957946624634880
    m_Localized: Fridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957968669896704
    m_Localized: Stop storing food in the drawer; keep it here (only affects aesthetics)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957982259441664
    m_Localized: Range hood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958013393760256
    m_Localized: Kitchen set
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15957987963695104
    m_Localized: It removes stuffy and musty odors, leaving only a faint sense of
      freshness in the kitchen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958040904200192
    m_Localized: Wooden rolling pin as a gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958053872988160
    m_Localized: Knife with cutting board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958076908105728
    m_Localized: Selling because the knife is stuck in the board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958105534230528
    m_Localized: Set of ultra-sharp knives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958119555788800
    m_Localized: Selling because they have all become dull
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958144528674816
    m_Localized: Box of magnets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958160752242688
    m_Localized: Found in the attic, inside are refrigerator magnets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958179597250560
    m_Localized: Alarm clock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958234408415232
    m_Localized: Elite armchair made from the leather of a sun-scorched crocodile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958193451036672
    m_Localized: Armchair
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958419461107712
    m_Localized: Bedside table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958192255660032
    m_Localized: There are a few dents (was thrown against the wall a few times)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958424695599104
    m_Localized: Always on the bed side
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958453334306816
    m_Localized: Bookshelf
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958466546364416
    m_Localized: The books are mostly dime novels, but it all looks very solid and
      intellectual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958481385811968
    m_Localized: Cactus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958502344749056
    m_Localized: "It feeds on negative energy, but it\u2019s still preferable to
      water it periodically"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958520380256256
    m_Localized: Carpet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958533722337280
    m_Localized: An elegant solution for your home or for disposing of a body
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958537681760256
    m_Localized: Gaming chair
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958554777743360
    m_Localized: "Stop saying it's not a gaming chair! Can't you see\u2014it's on
      wheels, so it's a gaming chair!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958578211319808
    m_Localized: Chandelier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958611031748608
    m_Localized: Floor lamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958681152122880
    m_Localized: Lamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958726081507328
    m_Localized: '"Hang in There" poster'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958739067072512
    m_Localized: Perfect for morning motivation and covering up cracks in the walls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958755458412544
    m_Localized: Wall paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958801667059712
    m_Localized: Windows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958821799718912
    m_Localized: A sledgehammer for making holes in walls is also included
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958579406696448
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t try spinning on it (we tried \u2014 it didn\u2019t work)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958626768777216
    m_Localized: "Not recommended if you don\u2019t have a floor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958695966404608
    m_Localized: Not recommended if you have a floor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15958784478801920
    m_Localized: "For those who have removed wallpaper but don\u2019t want to put
      it back up"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78354926239330304
    m_Localized: Sink
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
